    "detailed_description": "The Crimson Arrowhead calls to you, adventurer. It's a relic of immense power, guarded fiercely by waves of relentless enemies. Grab your bow, hone your reflexes, and dive into a 2D top-down roguelike pixel art style game where every arrow counts!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect ancient arrowheads \u2013 each imbued with elemental powers \u2013 and unleash devastating attacks. Control thunder with the Gold Arrowhead, rain down fire with the Red Arrowhead, or freeze your foes with the Ice Arrowhead and so on and so forth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnly by mastering these powers can you hope to stand against the final gauntlet \u2013 a brutal onslaught of bosses and relentless hordes.  Claim the Crimson Arrowhead and become a legend!",
    "about_the_game": "The Crimson Arrowhead calls to you, adventurer. It's a relic of immense power, guarded fiercely by waves of relentless enemies. Grab your bow, hone your reflexes, and dive into a 2D top-down roguelike pixel art style game where every arrow counts!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect ancient arrowheads \u2013 each imbued with elemental powers \u2013 and unleash devastating attacks. Control thunder with the Gold Arrowhead, rain down fire with the Red Arrowhead, or freeze your foes with the Ice Arrowhead and so on and so forth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnly by mastering these powers can you hope to stand against the final gauntlet \u2013 a brutal onslaught of bosses and relentless hordes.  Claim the Crimson Arrowhead and become a legend!",
    "short_description": "Dodge, weave, and unleash a storm of arrows as you battle hordes of enemies in this fast-paced 2D top-down roguelike pixel art style. Hunt for legendary arrowheads, master their unique powers, and become the ultimate treasure hunter!",
